      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{58c6cbcffd04b1785f747b6c|full_name} is correct, in our latest Open Beta changelog, we note this.\nIn the case of unsupported operating systems without access to WMF (Windows 7, Linux via Proton), this issue won't be fixed. We'll try to address the crash, however.\nFor Windows N, you will need to install the Media Feature Pack: https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/software-download/mediafeaturepack",
